WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:13.070
We, the students of Hillsdale College, commit
ourselves to diligent study and patient reflection.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:19.300
Having come to learn, we are proud to do so
with integrity and will conduct ourselves

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:29.779
with exemplary honor. As sacrifices past and
present make possible our education, we too

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:36.480
become stewards of this College for the generations
yet to come. We pledge ourselves to the pursuit

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:44.880
of truth, the love of the good, and the cultivation
of beauty, for the sake of our minds and hearts

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:53.610
and for an ennobled society. By so doing,
we embrace the high calling of liberal education.

